OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits driving theory test
OL,4,Aheadset fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted trying to cheat in
OL,7,Fhis driving theory test by using a
OL,8,FBluetooth device.
OL,10,FMiklovan Shahinaj, 31, went to Bradford
OL,11,FTheory Test Centre in Upper Piccadilly
OL,12,Fon 7 April last year where he was seen
OL,13,Fputting the device into a headset.
OL,15,FBradford and Keighley Magistrates'
OL,16,FCourt heard on Wednesday that he had
OL,17,Fdone so "with the intention of someone
OL,18,Felse assisting with the test".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
