OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits driving theory test
OL,4,Aheadset fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FShahinaj, of Radulf Gardens,
OL,7,FLiversedge, pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Fpossessing an article for use in fraud
OL,9,Fand has been bailed until sentencing on
OL,10,F8 March.
